<title>SIERRA LEONE: SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT SIERRA LEONE 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT SIERRA LEONE 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>FREETOWN 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco beat Sierra Leone 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a Group Five World cup qualifying match at the National Stadium on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer - Bassir Salaheddine 40</p>
<p>Red card:</p>
<p>Sierra Leone - Brima Kamara 75</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
